  "frame source: official Uni-Sign RTMPose pkl (How2Sign re-aligned clips, official signer crop, <=256 frames via upstream random.sample seeded per clip) instead of Kaggle/local MediaPipe; then the same P0.2 stride rule to <=150 frames",
  "no --baseline-checkpoint rescoring (the baseline is the existing P0.2 padfix run)"
